# Environment / secrets ------------------------------------------------------
# Real values never leave this machine. `.env.example` is the committed
# template and holds placeholders only (`REFRESH_TOKEN=change-me`), so it is
# re-included after the catch-all below.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env*
!.env.example

# Local deployment cheatsheet: plaintext DATABASE_URL (with password) and
# REFRESH_TOKEN. Never commit it; rotate both values if it ever gets pushed.
Deployment prerequisite.txt

